diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index b5fe1b2a4feac926b16f4b55fd72f2bb6eb7b711..df9b295ad7eda20dbf4497330238c55ba28e2dce 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -3,3 +3,14 @@
 The Lakeside Windsurf School teaches windsurfing on the lake from April to October, and rents boards and
 sails to its students and to visitors who bring their own experience. This repository holds the software
 of its booking desk, written in TypeScript with no runtime dependency.
+
+## Rental service
+
+`createRentalService()` creates an in-memory rental service. Add a board or sail with an integer
+daily price in euro cents, then use `quote` or `book` with UTC midnight ISO-8601 start and end
+timestamps. Rental periods are half-open: the end is the start of the day after the final rental
+day. `book` rejects any overlap for the same item; adjacent periods are allowed.
+
+Cancellation is intentionally not part of this first API. The school policy is retained for the
+future cancellation feature: cancellations at least 24 hours before the booking start receive the
+full amount; later cancellations receive no refund.
